# pkg-config metadata for MARLEY (Model of Argon Reaction Low Energy Yields)
#
# This file self-locates. pcfiledir is the directory holding this file --
# <prefix>/<libdir>/pkgconfig -- so two hops reach the prefix. That holds for
# lib and lib64 alike because the install-directory interface guarantees the
# library directory is exactly one segment below the prefix (design spec 4.3).
#
# There is no Requires: or Requires.private: line, and that is a statement
# about MARLEY's dependencies rather than an omission:
#
#   HepMC3 ships no pkg-config file. Not upstream (its CMakeLists installs
#   HepMC3Config.cmake, HepMC3Targets and the HepMC3-config script, and
#   nothing else), not in Debian, not in Homebrew. "Requires: HepMC3" would
#   name a package that does not exist, and pkg-config fails hard on an
#   unresolvable Requires -- so every query against this file would fail.
#   The dependency is carried as flat flags below instead.
#
#   ROOT ships no pkg-config file either, and is handled the same way.
#
#   GSL does ship gsl.pc, but it is a private dependency: it is used by
#   src/marley_gsl.cc and named in no installed header. Listing it as
#   Requires.private would put GSL's -I back into "pkg-config --cflags",
#   because pkg-config includes private dependencies' Cflags unconditionally
#   -- undoing the decision to keep GSL out of the compiler flags MARLEY
#   publishes (design spec 6.2).
#
# What this file carries is therefore exactly what marley-config --cflags and
# --libs carry, with one deliberate difference: no rpath. That covers both
# MARLEY's own -Wl,-rpath and the one root-config emits for ROOT's library
# directory, which is filtered out when this file is generated. A
# hand-written Makefile has no other way to make its binary runnable, while
# a packaging toolchain manages rpath itself -- and an inherited rpath
# naming the build machine's ROOT would travel into a redistributed binary
# and work only on the machine it was built on (design spec 6.3).
prefix=${pcfiledir}/../..
exec_prefix=${prefix}
libdir=${prefix}/@libdir_rel@
includedir=${prefix}/@includedir_rel@

Name: MARLEY
Description: Model of Argon Reaction Low Energy Yields
URL: https://www.marleygen.org
Version: @version@
Cflags: -I${includedir} -std=@cxx_std@ @pc_cflags_extra@
Libs: -L${libdir} -lMARLEY @pc_libs_extra@
